{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-jsx","path":"/DispatcherServlet의 동작 과정/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Wonyu"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"7eedce63-46d2-5594-8da2-2be92a40f2e6","excerpt":"✅ Spring MVC에서 프론트 컨트롤러 역할을 하는 핵심 서블릿 ✅ 모든 HTTP 요청을 받아 적절한 컨트롤러로 전달하고, 응답을 생성하여 클라이언트에게 반환 📌 Front Controller 패턴 ✅ 모든 요청을 한 곳에서 처리하고, 이후 적절한 컨트롤러로 위임하는 패턴 만약 DispatcherServlet이 없다면, \nServlet 컨테이너가 요청…","html":"<p>✅ <strong>Spring MVC에서 프론트 컨트롤러 역할을 하는 핵심 서블릿</strong><br>\n✅ <strong>모든 HTTP 요청을 받아 적절한 컨트롤러로 전달하고, 응답을 생성하여 클라이언트에게 반환</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"-Front-Controller-패턴\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-Front-Controller-%ED%8C%A8%ED%84%B4\" aria-label=\" Front Controller 패턴 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>📌 <strong>Front Controller 패턴</strong></h2>\n<p>✅ <strong>모든 요청을 한 곳에서 처리하고, 이후 적절한 컨트롤러로 위임하는 패턴</strong></p>\n<p>만약 DispatcherServlet이 없다면,\nServlet 컨테이너가 요청에 맞는 핸들러를 찾아야하며, <strong>모든 요청마다 개별 서블릿을 사용해야 한다.</strong>\n따라서 <strong>모든 요청을 DispatcherServlet이 처리</strong>하도록 하는 프론트 컨트롤러 패턴이 적용된다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"장점\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%9E%A5%EC%A0%90\" aria-label=\"장점 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>장점</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>모든 요청을 프론트 컨트롤러에서 관리하여 중복을 줄일 수 있음</strong></li>\n<li><strong>컨트롤러 별로 로직을 분리하면서도, 공통 작업(예: 보안, 로깅)을 프론트 컨트롤러에서 처리 가능</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"-요청-처리-과정\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-%EC%9A%94%EC%B2%AD-%EC%B2%98%EB%A6%AC-%EA%B3%BC%EC%A0%95\" aria-label=\" 요청 처리 과정 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 요청 처리 과정</strong></h2>\n<p><span class='gatsby-resp-image-wrapper' style='position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 680px; margin-bottom: 16px;'>\n      <a class='gatsby-resp-image-link' href='/static/6a9c823d3a32b84d23df5542da06cd48/1c0b8/dispatcherServlet.png' style='display: block' target='_blank' rel='noopener'>\n    <span class='gatsby-resp-image-background-image' style=\"padding-bottom: 24.705882352941178%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <img class='gatsby-resp-image-image' alt='dispatcherServlet' title='' src='/static/6a9c823d3a32b84d23df5542da06cd48/ca1dc/dispatcherServlet.png' srcset='/static/6a9c823d3a32b84d23df5542da06cd48/e7570/dispatcherServlet.png 170w,\n/static/6a9c823d3a32b84d23df5542da06cd48/f46e7/dispatcherServlet.png 340w,\n/static/6a9c823d3a32b84d23df5542da06cd48/ca1dc/dispatcherServlet.png 680w,\n/static/6a9c823d3a32b84d23df5542da06cd48/02d09/dispatcherServlet.png 1020w,\n/static/6a9c823d3a32b84d23df5542da06cd48/9d567/dispatcherServlet.png 1360w,\n/static/6a9c823d3a32b84d23df5542da06cd48/1c0b8/dispatcherServlet.png 2104w' sizes='(max-width: 680px) 100vw, 680px' style='width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;' loading='lazy' decoding='async'>\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<ol>\n<li>DispatcherServlet에 요청이 전달</li>\n<li>DispatcherServlet이 HandlerMapping를 활용해 <strong>적절한 핸들러를 조회</strong></li>\n<li>DispatcherServlet이 <strong>HandlerAdapter를 활용해</strong> 해당 <strong>핸들러를 실행</strong></li>\n<li>핸들러가 작성된 <strong>비즈니스 로직</strong>대로 요청을 처리</li>\n<li>핸들러가 반환값 반환</li>\n<li>핸들러 어댑터가 반환값 처리</li>\n<li>DispatcherServlet이 응답 반환</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"HandlerMapping\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#HandlerMapping\" aria-label=\"HandlerMapping permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>HandlerMapping</strong></h3>\n<p>✅ <strong>요청을 분석하여 어떤 컨트롤러가 처리할지 결정</strong><br>\n✅ <strong>적절한 컨트롤러를 찾아 반환</strong></p>\n<p><strong>HandlerMapping.class</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">interface</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">HandlerMapping</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  \n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Nullable</span>  \n    <span class=\"token class-name\">HandlerExecutionChain</span> <span class=\"token function\">getHandler</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">HttpServletRequest</span> request<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">throws</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Exception</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>🔹 <strong>getHandler(request)</strong><br>\n요청을 분석해 적절한 HandlerExecutionChain를 반환</p>\n<p>🔹 <strong>HandlerExecutionChain</strong><br>\nHandlerMapping이 찾은 핸들러(컨트롤러)와 해당 핸들러에 적용할 HandlerInterceptor(인터셉터)들을 함께 관리하는 객체</p>\n<p><strong>DispatcherServlet.class</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token keyword\">protected</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">HandlerExecutionChain</span> <span class=\"token function\">getHandler</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">HttpServletRequest</span> request<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">throws</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Exception</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>handlerMappings <span class=\"token operator\">!=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">null</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  \n        <span class=\"token class-name\">Iterator</span> var2 <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>handlerMappings<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">iterator</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n  \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">while</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>var2<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">hasNext</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  \n            <span class=\"token class-name\">HandlerMapping</span> mapping <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">HandlerMapping</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>var2<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">next</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n            <span class=\"token class-name\">HandlerExecutionChain</span> handler <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> mapping<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">getHandler</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>request<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>handler <span class=\"token operator\">!=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">null</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  \n                <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> handler<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>  \n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>  \n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>  \n  \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">null</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"HandlerAdapter\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#HandlerAdapter\" aria-label=\"HandlerAdapter permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>HandlerAdapter</strong></h3>\n<p>✅ <strong>HandlerMapping이 찾아준 컨트롤러를 실행하는 역할</strong></p>\n<p><strong>HandlerAdapter.class</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">interface</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">HandlerAdapter</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">boolean</span> <span class=\"token function\">supports</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">Object</span> handler<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n  \n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Nullable</span>  \n    <span class=\"token class-name\">ModelAndView</span> <span class=\"token function\">handle</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">HttpServletRequest</span> request<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">HttpServletResponse</span> response<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Object</span> handler<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">throws</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Exception</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>   \n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>🔹 <strong>supports(handler)</strong><br>\n해당 핸들러(컨트롤러)가 이 HandlerAdapter에서 실행할 수 있는지 확인하는 메서드</p>\n<p>🔹 <strong>handle(request, response, handler)</strong><br>\nHandlerMapping이 반환한 컨트롤러를 실행하는 메서드</p>\n<p><strong>DispatcherServlet.class</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token keyword\">protected</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">HandlerAdapter</span> <span class=\"token function\">getHandlerAdapter</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">Object</span> handler<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">throws</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ServletException</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>handlerAdapters <span class=\"token operator\">!=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">null</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  \n        <span class=\"token class-name\">Iterator</span> var2 <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>handlerAdapters<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">iterator</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n  \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">while</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>var2<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">hasNext</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  \n            <span class=\"token class-name\">HandlerAdapter</span> adapter <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">HandlerAdapter</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>var2<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">next</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>adapter<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">supports</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>handler<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  \n                <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> adapter<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>  \n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>  \n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>  \n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"-궁금했던-점\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-%EA%B6%81%EA%B8%88%ED%96%88%EB%8D%98-%EC%A0%90\" aria-label=\" 궁금했던 점 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 궁금했던 점</strong></h2>\n<h3 id=\"어떻게-다양한-타입의-응답-데이터를-처리할까\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%96%B4%EB%96%BB%EA%B2%8C-%EB%8B%A4%EC%96%91%ED%95%9C-%ED%83%80%EC%9E%85%EC%9D%98-%EC%9D%91%EB%8B%B5-%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%84%B0%EB%A5%BC-%EC%B2%98%EB%A6%AC%ED%95%A0%EA%B9%8C\" aria-label=\"어떻게 다양한 타입의 응답 데이터를 처리할까 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>어떻게 다양한 타입의 응답 데이터를 처리할까?</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>RequestMappingHandlerAdapter.class</strong>\n핸들러의 반환 <strong>응답 형식에 따라 분기하여 반환값을 처리</strong>한다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token keyword\">private</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">List</span><span class=\"token generics\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token class-name\">HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span> <span class=\"token function\">getDefaultReturnValueHandlers</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  \n    <span class=\"token class-name\">List</span><span class=\"token generics\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token class-name\">HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span> handlers <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ArrayList</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">20</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n    handlers<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">add</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ModelAndViewMethodReturnValueHandler</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n    handlers<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">add</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">RequestResponseBodyMethodProcessor</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">getMessageConverters</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>contentNegotiationManager<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>requestResponseBodyAdvice<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> handlers<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"DispatcherServlet이-다양한-응답-형식을-어떻게-추상화해서-반환하는가\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#DispatcherServlet%EC%9D%B4-%EB%8B%A4%EC%96%91%ED%95%9C-%EC%9D%91%EB%8B%B5-%ED%98%95%EC%8B%9D%EC%9D%84-%EC%96%B4%EB%96%BB%EA%B2%8C-%EC%B6%94%EC%83%81%ED%99%94%ED%95%B4%EC%84%9C-%EB%B0%98%ED%99%98%ED%95%98%EB%8A%94%EA%B0%80\" aria-label=\"DispatcherServlet이 다양한 응답 형식을 어떻게 추상화해서 반환하는가 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>DispatcherServlet이 다양한 응답 형식을 어떻게 추상화해서 반환하는가?</strong></h3>\n<p>DispatcherServlet은 실제로는 응답을 반환하는 것이 아닌 <strong>HttpServletResponse에 응답 데이터가 기록되도록 한다.</strong> 따라서 다양한 HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler가 HttpServletResponse에 응답 데이터를 기록한다.</p>\n<p><strong>DispatcherServlet.class</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token keyword\">protected</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">doDispatch</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">HttpServletRequest</span> request<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">HttpServletResponse</span> response<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">throws</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Exception</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token class-name\">HandlerExecutionChain</span> mappedHandler <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">getHandler</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>request<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>mappedHandler <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">null</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token function\">noHandlerFound</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>request<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> response<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token class-name\">HandlerAdapter</span> ha <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">getHandlerAdapter</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>mappedHandler<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">getHandler</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\">// 🚀 컨트롤러 실행</span>\n    <span class=\"token class-name\">ModelAndView</span> mv <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> ha<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">handle</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>request<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> response<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> mappedHandler<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">getHandler</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token comment\">// 🚀 반환된 결과를 처리</span>\n    <span class=\"token function\">processDispatchResult</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>request<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> response<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> mappedHandler<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> mv<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">null</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"-참고\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-%EC%B0%B8%EA%B3%A0\" aria-label=\" 참고 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 참고</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/reference/web/webmvc/mvc-servlet.html\">https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/reference/web/webmvc/mvc-servlet.html</a>\n<a href=\"https://mangkyu.tistory.com/18\">https://mangkyu.tistory.com/18</a></p>","frontmatter":{"title":"DispatcherServlet의 동작 과정","date":"February 22, 2025","update":"February 22, 2025","tags":["Spring"],"series":"Spring 기초 이해"},"fields":{"slug":"/DispatcherServlet의 동작 과정/","readingTime":{"minutes":4.115}}},"seriesList":{"edges":[{"node":{"id":"ce176831-2da9-5cc0-a6b1-e2cbcfe4f0a0","fields":{"slug":"/WAS와 Servlet/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"WAS와 Servlet"}}},{"node":{"id":"7eedce63-46d2-5594-8da2-2be92a40f2e6","fields":{"slug":"/DispatcherServlet의 동작 과정/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"DispatcherServlet의 동작 과정"}}},{"node":{"id":"5f1a2e65-bd7b-5447-9d1d-8cf9d88a7d21","fields":{"slug":"/IoC Container/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"IoC Container"}}},{"node":{"id":"0805ba38-d23a-51c5-8cd0-a24b00a07145","fields":{"slug":"/Spring Filter & Interceptor/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Filter & Interceptor"}}},{"node":{"id":"a34f7e04-a092-5e68-8da5-5d4f8a6bf33b","fields":{"slug":"/Spring 예외 처리/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Spring 예외 처리"}}},{"node":{"id":"75ac2b4e-2346-5bc3-925c-9dd8570d5320","fields":{"slug":"/Spring AOP/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Spring AOP"}}}]},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/WAS와 Servlet/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"WAS와 Servlet"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/기존 Layered Architecture에 대한 고민/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"기존 Layered Architecture에 대한 고민"}}},"pageCont